  "description": "Jolpica F1 is a community-maintained Formula 1 data API that preserves Ergast-compatible endpoints for race results, qualifying, lap times, pit stops, driver and constructor standings, and circuit information after Ergast\u2019s service changes. It targets developers building F1 apps, analytics tools, and season trackers who need a drop-in or near-drop-in replacement for Ergast-style queries.",
